{
  "slug": "blackwork-geometric-border-corners",
  "title": "Geometric border with corners",
  "subtitle": "A mitered corner where the border arms meet cleanly",
  "excerpt": "A geometric border repeat with a mitred corner unit. The corner turns the horizontal and vertical arms of the border at 45 degrees so the two arms meet without gaps or overlaps. The corner unit must be stitched before the arms to position correctly.",
